/Title (Traditionally, the gospel is said to have been written shortly before A.D. 70 in Rome, amid impending persecution and as destruction loomed over Jerusalem. Its audience seems to have been Gentile, unfamiliar with Jewish customs. The Gospel aimed to equip such Christians to stand faithful in the face of persecution while still continuing to proclaim the gospel to others.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 627 0 R
/Prev 822 0 R
>>
