/Title (On the Second Sunday of Advent, we welcome Fr. Ben Cameron of the Fathers of Mercy as the homilist at all of our weekend Masses. Fr. Cameron will preach in preparation for our Parish Mission. Then, on Sunday evening \(Dec. 6th\) at 7:00 PM, Fr. Cameron will offer the first of four mission talks. The four talks will be at 7:00 PM each evening, Sunday through Wednesday \(Dec. 9th\).)
